+
+## Bulk import
+
+`importTasks(list, text)` adds many tasks at once, for teams moving over from a spreadsheet. The text holds
+one task per line as `title;priority;tags`, for example `Renew the insurance;high;admin money`: the
+priority may be empty for a normal one, and tags are separated by spaces. Blank lines are skipped. It
+returns `{ imported, rejected }`, where `rejected` lists each line that could not be added as
+`{ line, reason }`, `line` counting from 1; the other lines are still added.
